{"schemaVersion":1,"id":34,"sections":[{"id":"114001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1130],"start":0,"count":12},{"id":"114001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11120],"start":12,"count":3},{"id":"114002-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1140],"start":15,"count":11},{"id":"114002-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11130],"start":26,"count":8},{"id":"114003-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1150],"start":34,"count":7},{"id":"114003-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11140],"start":41,"count":10}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:2","scriptId":1130,"text":"由于教官成功打开了“入口”，得以顺利进入研究所内部。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:3","scriptId":1130,"text":"不过因为吉普车开不进来，所以我只能把不明物体装到背包里徒步跟随……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:4","scriptId":1130,"text":"穿过围墙，一栋栋的研究大楼出现在众人眼前。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:5","scriptId":1130,"text":"“好大的研究所……要比齐格菲那边的研究所规模大很多啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:6","scriptId":1130,"text":"“齐格菲设置的防御工事太多，特别是那些‘龙牙’相当占地方，基本没什么地方留给研究所，所以规模很小。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:7","scriptId":1130,"text":"“不过这也差太多了吧，感觉这里要比齐格菲研究所大了至少有个五到六倍吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:8","scriptId":1130,"text":"“话说，你们还不知道吧，这里曾经参与过开发钢舞姬的核心。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:9","scriptId":1130,"text":"“诶！？那这样说起来，这里还是个有点历史的研究所啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:10","scriptId":1130,"text":"“那都是过去了，现在这里设施老化，外加运输设备麻烦，所以最后也就被当成了一般的研究所而已。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:11","scriptId":1130,"text":"就在这时，周围传来了战车兽的怒吼。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:12","scriptId":1130,"text":"“里面也有战车兽！！？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-PROLOGUE:1130:13","scriptId":1130,"text":"“还以为到了里面就安全了呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-EPILOGUE:11120:1","scriptId":11120,"text":"“刚才的战斗可能会吸引不少的战车兽，此处不宜久留。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":103,"right":40,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-EPILOGUE:11120:2","scriptId":11120,"text":"“那栋最高的大楼看上去应该是主楼，我们去那边？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114001-EPILOGUE:11120:3","scriptId":11120,"text":"“好，那么就行动吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:2","scriptId":1140,"text":"一群人开始向主楼进发，很快就到达了那栋非常巨大的建筑物前。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:3","scriptId":1140,"text":"“到了到了，后面的快跟上！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:4","scriptId":1140,"text":"“到是到了，不过现在有件事情要决定一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:5","scriptId":1140,"text":"“这种时候还有什么事情要做？","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:6","scriptId":1140,"text":"“当然就是哪些人留下来守门呗……总不见得我们全进研究大楼吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:7","scriptId":1140,"text":"“也是，那你们都留下，我一个人进主楼展开搜查任务。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:8","scriptId":1140,"text":"“诶！！？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:9","scriptId":1140,"text":"“与其让你们在研究大楼里瞎晃，还不如我这个比较熟路的人单独行动来得便捷。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:10","scriptId":1140,"text":"“那就这样，把背包给我。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:11","scriptId":1140,"text":"“哦……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114002-PROLOGUE:1140:12","scriptId":1140,"text":"说完索菲亚教官就只身进入了研究大楼，留下我们一堆替她“看门”的……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114002-EPILOGUE:11130:1","scriptId":11130,"text":"索菲亚教官进入大楼的期间，果然涌来了一批战车兽，不过很快就被我们清理掉了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":211,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-EPILOGUE:11130:2","scriptId":11130,"text":"“希望教官动作快点，不然今天就只能在这里过夜了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-EPILOGUE:11130:3","scriptId":11130,"text":"“过夜就过夜，又没什么关系。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-EPILOGUE:11130:4","scriptId":11130,"text":"“这里现在已经沦为了敌人的腹地，在这里过夜就好比在敌人的肚子上睡觉。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-EPILOGUE:11130:5","scriptId":11130,"text":"“另一个原因是索菲亚教官也不在，我们这边战斗力一下子弱了一大截……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-EPILOGUE:11130:6","scriptId":11130,"text":"“被你们这么一说，好像留下来的我们处境更危险……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-EPILOGUE:11130:7","scriptId":11130,"text":"“怪不得教官要单独行动的时候长官的反应那么大……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114002-EPILOGUE:11130:8","scriptId":11130,"text":"“唉……打起十二分精神吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114003-PROLOGUE:1150:2","scriptId":1150,"text":"索菲亚教官探查着研究大楼内的情况。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-PROLOGUE:1150:3","scriptId":1150,"text":"（从这凌乱的研究室来看，应该是受到了突袭。）","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":216,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114003-PROLOGUE:1150:4","scriptId":1150,"text":"一个拐角处，看到了一具研究人员残破不堪的尸体。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":216,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-PROLOGUE:1150:5","scriptId":1150,"text":"（一击毙命……这巨大的爪痕，应该是熊类的战车兽所为。）","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":216,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114003-PROLOGUE:1150:6","scriptId":1150,"text":"索菲亚蹲下身子开始进一步观察尸体。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":216,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-PROLOGUE:1150:7","scriptId":1150,"text":"（这身上的齿痕，看来是死后被战车兽啃咬，但是并没有被完全吞吃……这不符合战车兽的行动原理。）","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":216,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114003-PROLOGUE:1150:8","scriptId":1150,"text":"索菲亚起身，继续向大楼深处走去。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":216,"right":40,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"114003-EPILOGUE:11140:1","scriptId":11140,"text":"正门的战斗也稍微消停了一会儿。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":216,"right":40,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-EPILOGUE:11140:2","scriptId":11140,"text":"“呼……在教官回来之前应该还能撑住，围墙内侧的战车兽不是很多。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-EPILOGUE:11140:3","scriptId":11140,"text":"“不过有点让人觉得奇怪的是，明显这里已经被战车兽占领了，但是内部的战车兽数量反而不多。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-EPILOGUE:11140:4","scriptId":11140,"text":"“或许战车兽不喜欢研究所的味道？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":41,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-EPILOGUE:11140:5","scriptId":11140,"text":"“战车兽喜不喜欢研究所的味道我不知道，但是我可以肯定，它们一定喜欢佐伊你的味道。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":41,"right":87,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":34,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-EPILOGUE:11140:6","scriptId":11140,"text":"“诶！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":34,"right":87,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-EPILOGUE:11140:7","scriptId":11140,"text":"“莉娜，不要闹了……研究所内部是有使用驱散战车兽的喷雾，不过这味道已经相当淡了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":34,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-EPILOGUE:11140:8","scriptId":11140,"text":"“诶？奈乐的鼻子那么灵敏？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-EPILOGUE:11140:9","scriptId":11140,"text":"“还好，只是嗅觉比你们发达点而已。现在研究所里血腥味更浓烈……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":40,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"114003-EPILOGUE:11140:10","scriptId":11140,"text":"（恐怕研究人员都已经不幸罹难了吧……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-07.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["穿过破碎的围墙，来到了研究所内部。","通往主楼的路上。","索菲亚教官探查着研究大楼内的情况。"]}
